"We were successful renting the property to respectable people," he said. "We screen the people so they don't have wild parties."
Parish Councilwoman Jennifer Van Vrancken, whose district includes Bucktown and much of Metairie, said she is open to tweaking the law but probably not before it takes full effect next year.
